default on its debt.

00:00:46.260 --> 00:00:52.140
I believe that Republicans are more than willing
to damage the country by holding out on the

00:00:52.140 --> 00:00:53.600
debt ceiling debate.

00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:58.430
