happens is going to happen.

00:00:58.430 --> 00:01:05.680
The U.S. will not default on its debt and
even the Freedom Caucus crazies are not going

00:01:05.680 --> 00:01:07.860
to ultimately make that happen.

00:01:07.860 --> 00:01:09.880
